<title>CHINA: Bankers Trust sets warrants on property stocks.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust sets warrants on property stocks.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankers Trust International Plc said on Thursday it had launched 255 million American style call warrants on a basket of China property and construction shares.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> China Resources Beijing Land	0.25 shares</p>
<p> Shum Yip Investment Ltd	     0.20 shares</p>
<p> Nam Fong International Ltd	  0.25 shares</p>
<p> New World Development Co Ltd	0.04 shares</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE     HK$6.3223    PREMIUM    24.6 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	HK$0.1970    GEARING    3.37X</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT   HK$6.6550    PAYDATE    2-3 WKS AFTER LAUNCH</p>
<p> MATURITY	   31.JUL.98    EXER. LOT  20,000</p>
<p> LISTING	    HONG KONG</p>
<p> NOTE		 PHYSICAL SHARES WITH CASH ALTERNATIVE AT</p>
<p>			ISSUER'S DISCRETION</p>
<p>-- HONG KONG NEWSROOM (9852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
